{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Can't See!</strong>\u00a0<strong>but your senses draws the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your vision and memory due to an accident. Your guide cane became your new &quot;eye&quot;! You navigate environments that are familiar or distant\u2014 home, subway, a bustling street\u2014illuminating objects through touch and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/21cd0566f6304f0ee161f7c610594149.poster.avif?t=1773210374\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/21cd0566f6304f0ee161f7c610594149.webm?t=1773210374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/21cd0566f6304f0ee161f7c610594149.mp4?t=1773210374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Your Cane</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each touch, your cane brings the world to life. Uncover objects that hold meaning, from a humming boombox to the scent of a flowering plant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/e7fe9880f499256b7755c44b4f618bda.poster.avif?t=1773210374\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/e7fe9880f499256b7755c44b4f618bda.webm?t=1773210374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/e7fe9880f499256b7755c44b4f618bda.mp4?t=1773210374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this unique experience immersive, whether you\u2019re a casual player seeking a heartfelt narrative journey, or someone who wants the tension of a true-to-life simulation. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/68a44199c54082918a85da32b35d3957.poster.avif?t=1773210374\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/68a44199c54082918a85da32b35d3957.webm?t=1773210374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/68a44199c54082918a85da32b35d3957.mp4?t=1773210374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Discover, and Interact</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your surroundings not just by cane, but through hearing, memory, and imagination. Listen for distant footsteps, the rush of a subway train, or the breeze through trees as you piece together your world. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3521660/864cdd33edbc7b771fcda5be795c13d7b48de906.jpg"},{"name":"Safe at Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3521660/9d725b3ffd927164df4b0b8ca2d10072cd3c85f4.jpg"},{"name":"Mind the Gap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3521660/ad0dd21e7e0a2c15b9fdda97f1bc93adbc2adef1.jpg"},{"name":"City Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3521660/f461aeeda66740c429ebc55ab9940e77c74fa22a.jpg"},{"name":"Ba